/-!
# A174208

Write natural numbers in base 2 as a stream of digits. Moving left to right, delete odd occurrences of digit 0 and even occurrences of digit 1.

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A174208

